@Centeva.DomainModeling.SampleApp_HostAddress = https://localhost:7219

### Open a new account
POST {{Centeva.DomainModeling.SampleApp_HostAddress}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "initialDeposit": 500.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

###

### Get account by id (replace with a real id from the POST response)
@accountId = 7cc958fd-977e-4462-9f8c-43175b009f86
GET {{Centeva.DomainModeling.SampleApp_HostAddress}}/accounts/{{accountId}}

###

### Get account by account number (replace with a real account number from the POST response)
@accountNumber = ACC-00000000000000000000000000000000
GET {{Centeva.DomainModeling.SampleApp_HostAddress}}/accounts/by-number/{{accountNumber}}

###

### Deposit funds
POST {{Centeva.DomainModeling.SampleApp_HostAddress}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

###

### Withdraw funds
POST {{Centeva.DomainModeling.SampleApp_HostAddress}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

###
